    <string name="application_exchange_specific_policy">To ensure the accuracy of exchange rate calculations, we will connect to the internet to obtain the latest exchange rate information. If you deny, we will not actively connect to obtain data, but please note that the exchange rate calculation results may be less accurate. This consent for internet access applies only to the exchange rate calculation feature. For other modules (such as personal tax, housing loan), you may click Connect below the relevant feature and consent to use the internet feature for that module as needed.</string>
    <string name="application_loan_specific_policy">To ensure the accuracy of housing loan calculations, we will connect to the internet to obtain the latest LPR housing loan rates and tax rates. If you deny, we will not actively connect to obtain data, but please note that the housing loan calculation results may be less accurate. This consent for internet access applies only to the housing loan calculation feature. For other modules (such as income tax, exchange rates), you may click Connect below the relevant feature and consent to use the internet feature for that module as needed.</string>
    <string name="application_specific_policy">When using advanced features for housing loan, income tax, and currency, to ensure the accuracy of the calculations, we will connect to the internet to obtain the latest LPR housing loan rates, special deduction ratios, tax rates, and currency information. If you deny, we will not actively connect to obtain data, but please note that the calculation results may be less accurate.</string>
    <string name="application_tax_specific_policy">To ensure the accuracy of income tax calculations, we will connect to the internet to obtain the latest special deduction ratios and tax rates. If you deny, we will not actively connect to obtain data, but please be aware that the personal tax calculation results may be less accurate. This consent for internet access applies only to the personal tax calculation feature. For other modules (such as exchange rates, housing loan), you may click Connect below the relevant feature and consent to use the internet feature for that module as needed.</string>
